WEBVTT

00:00:14.142 --> 00:00:15.560
Cavalry!
骑兵队

00:00:17.479 --> 00:00:21.316
- Attack!
- (men shouting)
攻击

00:00:37.832 --> 00:00:40.126
Archers to the ready!
弓箭手预备

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.652
Narnians!
纳尼亚人

00:01:05.735 --> 00:01:09.030
- Charge!
- (all shouting)
进攻

00:01:24.003 --> 00:01:27.465
(fanfare sounding)

00:01:30.301 --> 00:01:33.471
One, two...
一、二

00:01:33.555 --> 00:01:35.974
Three, four...
三、四

00:01:36.057 --> 00:01:38.893
Five, six...
五、六

00:01:41.271 --> 00:01:42.730
Take your aim!
瞄准目标

00:01:44.607 --> 00:01:45.900
Stay with them!
继续瞄准

00:01:48.278 --> 00:01:51.281
Eight, nine...
八、九

00:01:51.364 --> 00:01:53.408
Get ready!
预备！

00:01:55.368 --> 00:01:56.703
Now!
就是现在！

00:02:18.892 --> 00:02:21.728
(man) Stop! Back! Back!

00:02:23.313 --> 00:02:27.275
(man) Hold it now! Hold it!

00:02:29.152 --> 00:02:30.820
Now!
射箭！

00:02:45.919 --> 00:02:48.796
Charge!
进攻！

00:03:01.476 --> 00:03:02.810
Charge!
进攻！

00:03:18.326 --> 00:03:19.953
(yelling)

00:03:29.921 --> 00:03:31.589
You're a mouse.
你是一只老鼠

00:03:31.673 --> 00:03:34.050
You people have no imagination.
你们人类还真没想象力

00:04:04.706 --> 00:04:06.541
Loose!
放箭

00:04:14.882 --> 00:04:16.134
Lucy?
露西呢？

00:04:25.018 --> 00:04:26.561
Back to the How!
撤退

00:04:31.858 --> 00:04:33.318
Cut off their escape!
切断他们的退路

00:04:33.401 --> 00:04:34.736
(man) Loose!

00:04:36.529 --> 00:04:38.531
Loose!

00:04:45.705 --> 00:04:49.083
Brace yourselves!
大家小心

00:04:50.376 --> 00:04:51.919
Back to the How!

